[{"_1":2},"llms/mdx",{"_3":4},"data","# Use Lamassu as SaaS (/docs/pr-preview/pr-24/deployment/saas)\n\n\n\nLamassu SaaS offers the platform's capabilities in a managed environment. It is the right option when your team wants to focus on PKI and device identities, not on maintaining the infrastructure that supports them.\n\nWhat the service manages [#what-the-service-manages]\n\n* Platform availability and maintenance.\n* Automatic backups.\n* Version upgrades.\n* Technical support and SLA according to your plan.\n\nPlans [#plans]\n\n| Plan         |      Devices | Support        |     SLA |\n| ------------ | -----------: | -------------- | ------: |\n| Starter      |  Up to 1,000 | Email          |  99.5 % |\n| Professional | Up to 10,000 | Email and chat |  99.9 % |\n| Enterprise   |    Unlimited | Dedicated      | 99.99 % |\n\nRequest access [#request-access]\n\nContact the Lamassu team through [lamassu.io](https://lamassu.io) to request a demo or choose a plan.\n\nWhen you receive your instance's credentials, continue with [Get started](/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview).\n"]
